@startuml
title Metro Parking Service - Current Context and Extension Point
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Web / Mobile Client" as User

rectangle "Metro Mobility Service" as App {
  component "Car Park / Parking" as Parking
  component "Timetable Data and Route Search" as Timetable
  component "Shared API / Security" as Api
  component "Persistence" as Store
}

cloud "Transport for NSW Car Park API" as ParkingProvider
cloud "TfNSW GTFS Schedules and Realtime" as TransitProvider
cloud "TfNSW Opal Fare Dataset" as OpalProvider
cloud "Toll Calculator API (future)" as TollProvider
database "Versioned Transit Snapshot Storage (TBD)" as TransitStore
database "MongoDB" as Mongo

User --> Api : HTTPS requests
Api --> Parking
Api --> Timetable : versioned snapshots and realtime data
Parking --> ParkingProvider : live + historical occupancy
Parking --> Store
Timetable --> TransitProvider : scheduled ingestion
Timetable --> OpalProvider : versioned fare data
Timetable --> TransitStore : publish active and last-known-good snapshots
Store --> Mongo

note right of Timetable
  Timetable route search is planned in the client against a compact
  normalized schedule package. This service owns ingestion,
  snapshot publication, and separate fare/realtime data.
end note
@enduml
